ral</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are <br /> We are  <br />They are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're <br /> We're  <br />They're\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You are all in my class. <br />We are classmates. <br />They are my roommates.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Using Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adjectives to describe people, places and things. <br/> Adjectives come after the verb <span class=\"strong\"> to be</span>  and before nouns (people, places and things).", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You're nice. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She is cool.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He is a great roommate.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "silly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "funny, not serious", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My sister is silly! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le01ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "busy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a lot of work to do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am very busy - I have no time!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le01ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "picture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "photograph", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Nice picture! Who are they?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le01ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn1le01ob02re1img01.jpg ", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a picture of a group of friends. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 sentences about the picture. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice saying the sentences. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show your picture in class. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the people in the picture. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write 3 sentences about the picture. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about each person in the picture. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use vocabulary from the lesson.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}